{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301331","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301331","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430133101:0":{"text":"응. 우리 집 칠면조가 또 도망갔거든.","source_cn":"是的，因为我家的火鸡又跑掉了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDB8B9CDC95FA9DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430133102:0":{"text":"항상 북쪽 언덕으로 도망가는데, 딸이랑 둘이서 여기저기 찾아다니고 있지. 그런데 우리가 다가가기만 하면 퍼덕거리면서 멀리 날아간단 말이야...","source_cn":"它们总是趁我不注意跑到北边的山坡上，我和女儿四处找它们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63C6B737C48782C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430133103:0":{"text":"예전엔 남편이 있을 땐 잘 따랐는데. 칠면조들도 남편이 그리운가 봐.","source_cn":"以前我丈夫在家的时候，火鸡很听他的话，也许它们也想他了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2E7FB79D757D5E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:弗瑞达":{"text":"프리다","source":"弗瑞达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}